<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108098" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόβαθ-ρον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything put under, a
			base</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>footstool,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.94
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. νυμφικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1485.54
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a wooden framework</i> to support a couch, a kind of
				<i>rocking apparatus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.1.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.23.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.31.84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>keel</i> of a ship, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβάραθρον</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.169
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>step,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δἰ ὑποβάθρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Mag.</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				3.41
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>